- action(n1, "start process"): hallucinated step not described in the source text (SMC1).
- action(n5, "end process"), action(n10, "end process"), action(n12, "end process"): hallucinated intermediate steps; the source text directly states "the process ends" without specifying explicit pre-termination actions (SMC1).
- guard(b1, n6, v1 = 'Yes'): incorrectly conditions the continuation path on v1 ("is form complete"), whereas the source text explicitly ties continuation to the need to check income ("if we need to check the income, we continue") (SMC2/SMC4).